      "rotation": [
        "push-a",
        "pull-a",
        "legs-a",
        "push-b",
        "pull-b",
        "legs-b"
      ],
      "note": "Train 3 non-consecutive days per week (e.g. Mon/Wed/Fri) and always do the NEXT day in the rotation, regardless of the calendar. Each day recurs every ~2 weeks and each muscle is trained ~1x/week, so weekly sets per muscle are roughly halved (~4-7 with the fat-loss set counts). Progression and deload rules are unchanged."
    }
